{"4836490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonrise", "steam_appid": 4836490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D puzzle platformer where the environment is as much a part of the game as the puzzles themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun has disappeared, and in its place a tower stands silent; inhabited by small, mysterious creatures that seem to have arrived alongside the darkness. You are the Moon's avatar, and your only way is out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the structure, these creatures grant your character unique abilities when caught in a beam of light. Each power comes with a catch: they only work in contact with a surface, whether a floor, a wall, a ledge... The world around you isn't just scenery, it's the condition for everything you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the wordless wonder of Journey and ICO, levels are designed as open paths rather than linear sequences. Multiple routes lead to the same destination, each one demanding a different use of your abilities and the space around you. You choose how hard you want it to be.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D puzzle platformer where the environment is as much a part of the game as the puzzles themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun has disappeared, and in its place a tower stands silent; inhabited by small, mysterious creatures that seem to have arrived alongside the darkness. You are the Moon's avatar, and your only way is out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the structure, these creatures grant your character unique abilities when caught in a beam of light. Each power comes with a catch: they only work in contact with a surface, whether a floor, a 